# Harness self-tests: buildfail FAIL
# Copyright (c) 2026 Nicholas Martin. All rights reserved.

assertion  ST.buildfail.001
says       A test that does not compile, in a module with buildfail FAIL,
           is logged as FAIL with the compiler's first error.
test       t/001-no-compile.c
expect     FAIL

assertion  ST.buildfail.002
says       A test that compiles in such a module runs as usual.
test       t/002-compiles.c
expect     PASS
